{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved pure-logic class22 component pc-transfer-10. It distinguishes four outcomes: key absent -> missing/null, explicit null -> null/null, exact int 6..15 -> integer/original, else -> invalid/null. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions, no imports/I/O/host calls. Module-level result assignment. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-transfer-10", "description": "Classify raw ttl: missing -> {kind:"missing",ttl:null}; explicit null -> {kind:"null",ttl:null}; exact integer 6..15 -> {kind:"integer",ttl:original}; other -> {kind:"invalid",ttl:null}. No bool/float/coercion/defaults/exceptions. No imports/I/O/host calls. Unapproved target typed-inputs draft; selected-runner support, Q1 and human Q2 remain prerequisites.", "content": "ttl = inputs.get('ttl')
